uires explicit confirmation before installation."},{"evidencePath":"packages/execution-domain/src/strategy.ts:330","surface":"Approved strategy-package catalog","verifiedObservation":"The shared package catalog includes configurable Hyperliquid momentum templates and additional protected-order, limit, trigger, and TWAP packages."},{"evidencePath":"packages/protocol-adapter/src/hl-equity-catalog.ts:1","surface":"HIP-3 equity-reference catalog","verifiedObservation":"The shared venue-derived catalog maps NVIDIA/NVDA to xyz:NVDA as a Hyperliquid equity-reference perpetual, not a cash equity share."},{"evidencePath":"apps/api/src/lib/execution/hyperliquid-mainnet-readiness.ts:32","surface":"Account readiness","verifiedObservation":"Readiness is evaluated separately from product support and venue listing using connection, environment, signer, capability, incident-control, policy, approval, and account-snapshot checks."},{"evidencePath":"apps/api/src/lib/execution/storage.ts:4549","surface":"Durable agent registry","verifiedObservation":"Persistent strategy instances are stored in execution_strategy_instances and user-scoped reads exclude disabled strategies."}]},"safety":{"blindCasesAllocated":0,"blindCasesAuthored":0,"blindCasesRun":0,"financialMutations":0,"paidModelCalls":0,"productRuntimeCalls":0,"providerCalls":0},"scope":"Slice 1 only","validations":{"contract":{"issues":[],"valid":true},"exposureLedger":{"issues":[],"valid":true},"runRegistry":{"issues":[],"valid":true},"stabilityPanel":{"issues":[],"valid":true}}}
